      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Al Husayn Bin Muhammad, from Moala Bin Muhammad, from Al Hassan Bin Ali Al Washa, from Jameel Bin Darraj and Muhammad Bin Humran, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘They do not inherit (each other), the free and the slave’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "1. Al-Husayn from Muhammad has narrated from Mu‘alla’ ibn Muhammad from al-Hassan ibn Afi af-Washsha’ from Jamif ibn Darraj and Muhammad ibn Humran who has narrated the foiiowing: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘The free and slaves do not inherit each other.’” "
        ]
      }
